sequenceDiagram
    participant WF as Workflow Service
    participant Income as Income Service
    participant Bank as Bank Aggregator
    participant DB as Income DB
    participant Kafka as Event Bus

    WF->>Income: Verify income
    Income->>Bank: Fetch bank statements
    Bank-->>Income: Salary data
    Income->>DB: Persist income verification result
    DB-->>Income: Commit success
    Income->>Kafka: Publish INCOME_VERIFIED
    Kafka-->>WF: Event consumed
    WF-->>WF: Move to next stage
